The query in 0result.sql is the only one that  
• derives the correct Top‑5 markets,  
• returns every tournament game from the viewpoint of each Top‑5 market (win and loss sides), and  
• outputs all columns required by the data‑model spec, including days_from_epoch, label, seed/opponent_seed, etc.  

The other two queries miss required columns (1result.sql omits label and opponent fields; 2result.sql omits days_from_epoch) or may drop needed rows. Hence 0result.sql is the correct answer.

